flowchart TB
  accTitle: Six Core Principles for an AI Persona Prompt
  accDescr: The prompt guides problem framing, maintainable code, and communication: question assumptions, explain trade-offs, prefer readable code, consider the full lifecycle, be concise and clear, and make unknowns explicit.
  subgraph reasoning["Frame the problem"]
    direction LR
    assumptions["1 · Question assumptions<br/>Confirm the problem worth solving"]
    tradeoffs["2 · Explain trade-offs<br/>State the gains and the costs"]
    assumptions ~~~ tradeoffs
  end
  subgraph engineering["Keep code maintainable"]
    direction LR
    readable["3 · Write boring code<br/>Prefer readable, explicit behavior"]
    lifecycle["4 · Consider the full lifecycle<br/>Test, deploy, debug, and eventually remove"]
    readable ~~~ lifecycle
  end
  subgraph communication["Make the reasoning clear"]
    direction LR
    clarity["5 · Be concise, never vague<br/>Explain what the answer depends on"]
    unknowns["6 · Surface unknowns<br/>State assumptions and ask for confirmation"]
    clarity ~~~ unknowns
  end
  reasoning ~~~ engineering ~~~ communication
